<title>USA: Results awaited on Peru wheat tender - exporters.</title>
<headline>Results awaited on Peru wheat tender - exporters.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results were awaited on Peru's tender late Thursday for 25,000 tonnes of optional-origin spring or hard red winter wheat for last-half April shipment, exporters said.</p>
<p>One exporter said it had been expected that Argentina would make the sale, but results were pending.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
